---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us" description="Meet the founding team of Alonso & Campos Advisors, our mission, vision and values." lang="en">

  <!-- PAGE HEADER -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold)">Who we are</p>
      <h1 class="display-title" style="color:var(--white);">A firm built for<br><em style="color:var(--gold);">territory and the world</em></h1>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:580px;margin-top:1rem;line-height:1.75;">
        Founded by three partners with complementary expertise in organisational development, innovation and planning.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MISSION VISION VALUES -->
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--white);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mvv-grid">
        <div class="mvv-card mvv-mission">
          <div class="mvv-icon">M</div>
          <h2>Mission</h2>
          <p>
            To accompany organisations and public administrations in the responsible understanding
            and adoption of emerging technologies, with special emphasis on artificial intelligence,
            contributing to sustainable economic and social development that takes into account
            territories and people.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mvv-card mvv-vision">
          <div class="mvv-icon">V</div>
          <h2>Vision</h2>
          <p>
            To be a benchmark in strategic-technological advisory in Spain and Europe,
            recognised for our ability to operate at the confluence between digital
            innovation and the real needs of organisations that generate positive
            impact in society.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- VALUES -->
      <div style="margin-top:4rem;">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="text-align:center;">Our principles</p>
        <h2 class="display-title" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:3rem;">Values that guide every project</h2>
        <div class="values-grid">
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-line"></div>
            <h3>Rigour</h3>
            <p>Every analysis and recommendation is grounded in evidence, proven methodology and critical thinking.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-line"></div>
            <h3>Responsibility</h3>
            <p>We embrace the ethical, social and environmental sustainability of the solutions we propose.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-line"></div>
            <h3>Collaboration</h3>
            <p>We work with our clients, not for them. Shared knowledge produces better results.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-line"></div>
            <h3>Territory</h3>
            <p>We believe innovation must reach every place. Rural and singular territories are a central part of our raison d'être.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-line"></div>
            <h3>Clarity</h3>
            <p>We translate technological complexity into comprehensible, actionable decisions for those who make them.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <div class="value-line"></div>
            <h3>Independence</h3>
            <p>We act without conflicts of interest. Our recommendations respond exclusively to the client's objectives, regardless of any collaboration agreements we may maintain with technology partners.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOUNDING TEAM -->
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--ivory);">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Founding team</p>
      <h2 class="display-title" style="margin-bottom:3.5rem;">Three partners,<br><em>one firm</em></h2>

      <!-- Antonio -->
      <div class="bio-card" id="antonio">
        <div class="bio-avatar bio-avatar--photo">
          <img src="/images/antonio-alonso.webp" srcset="/images/antonio-alonso@2x.webp 2x" alt="Antonio Alonso Sánchez" width="200" height="200" />
        </div>
        <div class="bio-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Founding Partner</p>
          <div class="bio-name-row">
            <h3 class="bio-name">Antonio Alonso Sánchez</h3>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/antonio-alonso-s%C3%A1nchez-782880a6/" class="linkedin-btn" target="_blank" aria-label="Antonio Alonso Sánchez on LinkedIn" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="bio-tagline">Organisational development · Innovation · Planning</p>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <div class="bio-text">
            <p>
              With a long track record in designing and implementing innovation strategies
              for complex organisations, Antonio brings to the firm his ability to identify
              transformation opportunities and build roadmaps that connect the executive
              vision with operational reality.
            </p>
            <p>
              He has led organisational change processes in public and private entities, with
              special emphasis on stakeholder articulation and the design of governance systems
              adapted to each client's institutional context.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bio-tags">
            <span>Organisational innovation</span>
            <span>Strategic planning</span>
            <span>Institutional development</span>
            <span>Change management</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Erica -->
      <div class="bio-card" id="erica">
        <div class="bio-avatar bio-avatar--photo">
          <img src="/images/erica-campos-200.webp" srcset="/images/erica-campos-200.webp 1x, /images/erica-campos.webp 2x" alt="Erica Wurzba Campos" width="200" height="200" />
        </div>
        <div class="bio-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Founding Partner</p>
          <div class="bio-name-row">
            <h3 class="bio-name">Erica Wurzba Campos</h3>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ericawcampos/" class="linkedin-btn" target="_blank" aria-label="Erica Wurzba Campos on LinkedIn" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="bio-tagline">Systemic design · Leadership · Governance</p>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <div class="bio-text">
            <p>
              Erica combines her background in systemic design with deep experience in
              developing leadership capabilities and building governance frameworks
              for organisations undergoing transformation.
            </p>
            <p>
              Her integrative perspective connects the human, organisational and
              technological dimensions of change, generating proposals that are technically
              sound and culturally viable. She has accompanied executive teams in complex
              decision-making processes in high-uncertainty contexts.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bio-tags">
            <span>Systemic design</span>
            <span>Leadership development</span>
            <span>Organisational governance</span>
            <span>Process facilitation</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- José Eduardo -->
      <div class="bio-card" id="jose">
        <div class="bio-avatar bio-avatar--photo">
          <img src="/images/eduardo-campos-200.webp" srcset="/images/eduardo-campos-200.webp 1x, /images/eduardo-campos.webp 2x" alt="J. Eduardo Campos" width="200" height="200" />
        </div>
        <div class="bio-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Founding Partner</p>
          <div class="bio-name-row">
            <h3 class="bio-name">José Eduardo Campos</h3>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/j-eduardocampos/" class="linkedin-btn" target="_blank" aria-label="José Eduardo Campos on LinkedIn" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="bio-tagline">Digital transformation · Systemic design · AI</p>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <div class="bio-text">
            <p>
              José Eduardo leads the firm's technological dimension with a perspective that
              integrates technical rigour with systemic design. His specialisation in artificial
              intelligence and digital transformation allows him to advise organisations on the
              strategic adoption of emerging technologies with a long-term vision.
            </p>
            <p>
              He has directed design and implementation projects for digital platforms, data
              observatories and information systems for public, private and third-sector entities,
              both in Spain and internationally.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bio-tags">
            <span>Artificial intelligence</span>
            <span>Digital transformation</span>
            <span>Data architecture</span>
            <span>Systemic design</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SOCIAL COMMITMENT -->
  <section class="section sipam-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sipam-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold);">Social commitment</p>
          <h2 style="font-family:var(--ff-display);font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3vw,2.5rem);color:var(--white);margin-bottom:1rem;">
            GIAHS and rural territories
          </h2>
          <div class="divider" style="background:var(--gold);"></div>
          <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            Our firm explicitly includes in its corporate purpose the development of technological
            projects, information systems, artificial intelligence tools and digital solutions
            applied to rural territories, mountain areas and, in particular, the Globally Important
            Agricultural Heritage Systems (GIAHS) of the FAO.
          </p>
          <a href="/en/portafolio/#sipam" class="btn btn-gold">View GIAHS projects →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="sipam-lines">
          <div class="sipam-item">
            <span class="sipam-bullet">◈</span>
            <div>
              <strong>GIAHS platforms and observatories</strong>
              <p>Monitoring and visualisation systems for world agricultural heritage.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sipam-item">
            <span class="sipam-bullet">◈</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Heritage data repositories</strong>
              <p>Reusable data structures for territorial knowledge management.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sipam-item">
            <span class="sipam-bullet">◈</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Territorial knowledge management tools</strong>
              <p>Advanced solutions to document, preserve and disseminate rural heritage.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section style="background:var(--white);padding:4rem 0;text-align:center;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="display-title" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Want to work with us?</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin:0 auto 2rem;">Tell us about your project. We explore together whether there's a fit.</p>
      <a href="/en/contacto/" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1rem;padding:0.875rem 2.25rem;">Get in touch →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: var(--night);
    padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
    background-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 80% 50%, rgba(61,90,128,0.3) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }
  .mvv-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .mvv-card { padding: 3rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .mvv-mission { background: var(--night); }
  .mvv-vision  { background: var(--slate); }
  .mvv-card h2 { font-family: var(--ff-display); font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .mvv-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); line-height: 1.8; }
  .mvv-icon {
    font-family: var(--ff-display); font-size: 5rem; font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(200,169,110,0.15); position: absolute; top: 1rem; right: 1.5rem; line-height: 1;
  }
  .values-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2.5rem; }
  .value-line { width: 32px; height: 3px; background: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .value-item h3 { font-family: var(--ff-display); font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--night); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .value-item p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; }

  .bio-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: min-content 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .bio-card:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
  .bio-avatar {
    width: 200px; height: 200px;
    background: var(--night); color: var(--gold);
    font-family: var(--ff-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 2rem;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%; position: sticky; top: 90px; overflow: hidden; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .bio-avatar--photo { width: 200px; height: 200px; }
  .bio-avatar--photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .bio-name-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin: 0.25rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .bio-name { font-family: var(--ff-display); font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--night); margin: 0; }
  .linkedin-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; color: #0A66C2; flex-shrink: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
  .linkedin-btn:hover { opacity: 0.75; }
  .bio-tagline { font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold-text); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .bio-text p { color: var(--text); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .bio-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .bio-tags span {
    background: var(--ivory); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--night); border-radius: 2px; letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .sipam-section { background: var(--night); background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #111520 0%, #1e2a42 100%); }
  .sipam-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; align-items: start; }
  .sipam-lines { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.75rem; }
  .sipam-item { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; padding-bottom: 1.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,0.15); }
  .sipam-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .sipam-bullet { color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 0.1rem; min-width: 1.25rem; }
  .sipam-item strong { color: var(--white); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  .sipam-item p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .mvv-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .sipam-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .bio-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; justify-items: center; text-align: left; }
    .bio-avatar { position: static; }
    .bio-avatar--photo { width: 160px; height: 160px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
